    },
    {
      "id": "02-poem-01",
      "role": "zhixia",
      "text": "南州溽暑醉如酒，隐几熟眠开北牖。",
      "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_tianmeijiaoqiao_tob",
      "resource_id": "seed-tts-2.0",
      "revision": 1,
      "filename": "02-zhixia-poem-01.mp3",
      "status": "ready",
      "duration_ms": 4032,
      "request_id": "202608231256253E051D211ED5495A58C1"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-poem-02",
      "role": "ayan",
      "text": "离离暑云散，袅袅凉风起。",
      "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_jiaxiaozi_tob",
      "resource_id": "seed-tts-2.0",
      "revision": 1,
      "filename": "03-ayan-poem-02.mp3",
      "status": "ready",
      "duration_ms": 3048,
      "request_id": "20260823125626E5060E12757BB4658D4C"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-poem-03",
      "role": "zhixia",
      "text": "残暑蝉催尽，新秋雁戴来。",
      "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_tianmeijiaoqiao_tob",
      "resource_id": "seed-tts-2.0",
      "revision": 1,
      "filename": "04-zhixia-poem-03.mp3",
      "status": "ready",
      "duration_ms": 3864,
      "request_id": "202608231256275B42814A96C14EBC633E"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-outro",
      "role": "ayan",
      "text": "暑云将散，诗意未歇。第四句，你来接。",
      "speaker": "ICL_uranus_zh_female_jiaxiaozi_tob",
      "resource_id": "seed-tts-2.0",
